      "lesson_progress": 0.3333333333333333,
      "text": "Remember that a measure counts equal units. Millimetres help with small details, centimetres suit a pencil, metres suit a room, and kilometres suit a long journey. Choose a tool with useful markings. Smaller units can give a more precise measurement, rather than changing the object.",
